    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Alchemy Duel&quot; is a card game that combines elements of alchemy and roguelike gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Alchemize Monster Cards</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine material cards in your hand to alchemize powerful monster cards.<br>Each monster card comes with a unique effect, and by combining their abilities, you can create powerful synergies to gain the upper hand in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Obtain Relic Cards</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After each battle, you can visit a shop to purchase relic cards of your choice.<br>Relic cards enhance combos between your cards and provide various advantages during gameplay.<br>Choose relics that suit your strategy and prepare for the next challenge!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Alchemy Duel&quot; is a card game that combines elements of alchemy and roguelike gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Alchemize Monster Cards</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine material cards in your hand to alchemize powerful monster cards.<br>Each monster card comes with a unique effect, and by combining their abilities, you can create powerful synergies to gain the upper hand in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Obtain Relic Cards</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After each battle, you can visit a shop to purchase relic cards of your choice.<br>Relic cards enhance combos between your cards and provide various advantages during gameplay.<br>Choose relics that suit your strategy and prepare for the next challenge!</p>",
    "short_description": "Alchemy Duel is a card game that combines elements of alchemy and roguelike gameplay. Alchemize monsters suited to the situation and unleash powerful combos by making use of synergies between your cards!",
